DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       ppaappeerrccoonnffiigg sets the system (or default) paper to be used by tools  us‐
       ing  the ppaappeerrssiizzee file.  It can either ask interactively for the paper
       to use or be called non-interactively by scripts.

       When the paper size has been changed, ppaappeerrccoonnffiigg notifies other  pack‐
       ages of the change by running the scripts in the _/_e_t_c_/_l_i_b_p_a_p_e_r_._d direc‐
       tory.

